          "id": "him-insurance-101",
          "title": "US Healthcare & Insurance 101",
          "author": "SYNTHESIS Learning",
          "description": "Master the foundations of American healthcare from scratch — what insurance is, how plans work, Medicare, Medicaid, and how providers get paid. Zero prior knowledge assumed.",
          "lessons": 12,
