                  "explanation": "Allowed = $300. Deductible applied: $100 (patient owes). Remaining after deductible: $300 - $100 = $200. Patient coinsurance (20% x $200) = $40. Plan pays (80% x $200) = $160. Patient total: $100 + $40 = $140. The billed amount ($500) and write-off ($200) are irrelevant to the patient's actual liability."
