                  "explanation": "Medicare Part A uses a benefit period deductible (approximately $1,676 in 2024) for hospital days 1-60, not a percentage coinsurance. Days 61-90 carry a daily coinsurance ($419/day). The 20% coinsurance is a Part B feature, not Part A inpatient."
