                  "explanation": "Under COBRA, the former employee pays the FULL premium -- the share they paid plus the share the employer used to pay -- plus up to 2% administration fee (102% total). Coverage is available to dependents too, and the election window is 60 days, but coverage starts at the qualifying event date."
