                  "explanation": "Two MRNs for the same patient is a duplicate record - a data integrity failure. Maria's 2021 clinical history and any linked authorizations are under MRN 10045, while 2024 claims will be submitted under MRN 10892. The payer cannot match them. HIM staff must merge the records before resubmitting."
